WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Today your C++ code moves from the laptop to a real microcontroller.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Keep this first hardware lesson safe: USB only, no motors, no extra wiring.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:15.000
setup runs once. loop repeats again and again.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Choose the ESP32 board and the port connected to your board.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:02:15.000
The Serial Monitor lets the board talk back to you. Change the messages, upload again, and explain what runs once and what repeats.
